<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=5"><img src="images/topics/cinema.gif" border="0" Alt="Movies" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Our member <STRONG><A href="mailto:Orlandodisneyboy@aol.com">Jim</A></STRONG> 
has sent us his review of <STRONG>Jennifer Garner</STRONG>'s <STRONG>"13 Going 
On 30"</STRONG> movie <EM>"featuring"</EM> <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>. If you 
don't want to know the plot, don't read below... after the SPOILER ALERT. 
<BR><BR>Ohmigosh guys - I just saw the best movie! <STRONG>Jennifer 
Garner</STRONG>'s <STRONG>"13 Going On 30"</STRONG> is SOOOOO great! It's a 
fantastic story about a little 13 year old girl who gets frustrated and wishes 
to be an adult, and gets her wish.<BR><BR><STRONG>***SPOILER 
ALERT***</STRONG><BR><BR>Before she wishes to grow up, <STRONG>"Crazy for 
You"</STRONG> is playing on her stereo in her basement. When she wakes up grown 
up - she goes to her office to discover an autographed photo of 
<STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> (the signature was REAL!) and says "I'm friends 
with...(gasp) <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>!"<BR><BR>Later on, at the very end of the 
movie, when the final song rolls, it's an extended version of <STRONG>"Crazy For 
You"</STRONG> - and there's not a dry eye in the audience! It's SOOOOO good, 
that if you don't love it, then you are totally heartless!  I wanted to 
stand up and cheer at the end it was soooooooo good!<BR><BR>And it occurred to 
me how smart <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> is - the 80's are coming back in a big way 
- you can tell this is just the beginning - who better to lead a trend than 
<STRONG>M</STRONG>?<BR><BR>This is soooo awesome!  Go see it when it comes 
out! You will not just like it, you will LOVE it! <br><br><b>Note:</b> <i><STRONG>First published on a Madonna website.</STRONG></i>

</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


