<P><STRONG>Event Title: Madonna - The Re-invention World Tour – 4th &amp; Final Show Added!</STRONG> <BR>Dates: <STRONG>Thu Jul 1</STRONG> <BR>Type of Show: CONCERT <BR>Show Times: 8PM <BR>Pricing: <STRONG>$45.00, $90.00, $150.00 and $300.00</STRONG> <BR>Floorplan: Endstage <BR>Details: <BR>The Fans Have Spoken!<BR>We Want More Madonna!<BR><STRONG>Due To Overwhelming Demand A 4TH &amp; FINAL Show<BR>Added In Worcester!<BR></STRONG><BR><BR><BR><STRONG>Following immediate sell-outs of Madonna performances on June 27th and 28th at Worcester’s Centrum Centre, a 3rd show -June 30th was announced and put on this past Monday. Once again, the Material Girl's star continues to shine and a 4th and final show - Thursday, July 1st at 8PM has now been announced. <BR><BR>Coast to Coast... Around The World... She Is The Original Queen Of Pop. She Is MADONNA! The tour will sweep across major markets in the U.S. including Los Angeles, San Francisco, New York, Philadelphia, Chicago, Atlanta and Miami and then continue with stops in London, Paris and proposed visits to Israel and Ireland. These performances mark Madonna’s ONLY NEW ENGLAND APPEARANCES!<BR><BR>Madonna’s “Re-invention World Tour” is rumored to be an extravagant stage spectacle. Her first since 2001’s "Drowned World Tour" – the Material Girl, now better known as the Etherial Girl is expected to bring fans on a journey through time and will perform songs from American Life, Music, Ray of Light, and other numbers spanning her iconic career. <BR><BR></STRONG>Tickets priced at $45.00, $90.00, $150.00 and $300.00 plus applicable convenience and handling fees will go on sale to the general public on Monday, April 12th 2004 at 10AM. Tickets will be available at the Centrum Centre Box Office, all Ticketmaster locations, charge-by-phone by calling 617-228-6000 or 617-931-2000 and online at ticketmaster.com. There is a six (6) ticket limit per person. Wristbands are now being distributed at Worcester’s Centrum Centre Box Office. A wristband guarantees a spot in line the morning tickets go on sale at the Box Office, but does not guarantee tickets </P>
<P><STRONG><EM>First published on a Madonna website</EM></STRONG></P>
